  "_connlog": "OPTIONAL, LOG-ONLY (2026-10-01). connlog_devices = explicit ALLOWLIST of monitored devices -> IPs (a device's home and tunnel IPs together); unset = off. Peers per `uci show wireguard_server`: 10.1.0.2 Jonahs-Mac, 10.1.0.3 JJPWS-Phone (Jonah's phone), 10.1.0.4 Jonahs-Mac-Remote, 10.1.0.5 Jadas-Phone. Jada's phone is EXCLUDED and must never be read: connlog_excluded_ips (default [\"10.1.0.5\"]) can't be overridden by connlog_devices -- the code refuses them. Stats only (aggregate counters, hourly): no alerts.",
